    '{"en": "History of freestyle skiing - From hot doggers and rebels to mainstream winter sport, discover how acrobatic skiing evolved into moguls, aerials, and slopestyle.", "de": "Geschichte des Freestyle-Skiing - Von Hot Doggern und Rebellen zum Mainstream-Wintersport.", "fr": "Histoire du ski freestyle - Des hot doggers et rebelles au sport d''hiver grand public.", "it": "Storia dello sci freestyle - Dagli hot dogger e ribelli allo sport invernale mainstream.", "es": "Historia del esquí estilo libre - De hot doggers y rebeldes al deporte de invierno convencional.", "pt": "História do esqui estilo livre - De hot doggers e rebeldes ao esporte de inverno convencional.", "nl": "Geschiedenis van freestyle skiën - Van hot doggers en rebellen tot mainstream wintersport.", "ar": "تاريخ التزلج الحر - من الهوت دوغرز والمتمردين إلى الرياضة الشتوية السائدة", "ja": "フリースタイルスキーの歴史 - ホットドッガーと反逆者から主流のウィンタースポーツへ", "zh": "Ziyoushi huaxue lishi - Cong re gou zhe he panpan zhe dao zhuliu dongji yundong", "ko": "프리스타일 스키의 역사 - 핫도거와 반항아에서 주류 겨울 스포츠로"}'::jsonb,
